    "hash_policy": "no hash literals are stored; every original_sha256 and source_sha256 is the sha256 of the listed seed string, computed at test time",
    "oracle_policy": "expected dispositions, reasons, multiplicities and counts below are literal and were written independently of the product grouping function"
